# Text Generation – All-in-One

```javascript
// Init client
const client = new AIClient({
  apiKey:'YOUR_API_KEY',
  model:'flux',
  stream:true,     // live chunks
  isImage:false,   // text mode
  seed:12345,      // repeatable output
  chatId:'t1',
  timeout:60000,
  retry:true,
  retryAttempts:2,
  retryDelay:1000
});

// Optional configs
client.config.systemPrompt='Helpful assistant';
client.clearHistory();

// Streaming events
client.addEventListener('message', e => {
  const { data, stream } = e.detail;
  if(stream) console.log('Chunk:', data);
  else console.log('Final:', data);
});

// Generate text
await client.generate('Write a short motivational quote about AI.');

// Cleanup
client.destroy();
```

**Notes:**
- `stream:true` gives live chunks
- `seed` makes output repeatable
- Auto cleanup removes `chatId` after generate/stream
- `clearHistory()` resets conversation

# Image Generation – All-in-One

```javascript
// Init client
const client = new AIClient({
  apiKey:'YOUR_API_KEY',
  model:'flux',
  isImage:true,   // image mode
  width:1024,
  height:1024,
  seed:12345,     // reproducible image
  chatId:'i1',
  timeout:60000,
  retry:true,
  retryAttempts:2,
  retryDelay:1000
});

// Optional configs
client.setTimeout(30000);
client.setRetry(true,2,1000);
client.setSeed(12345);

// Generate image
const blob = await client.generate('Futuristic city at sunset');
document.querySelector('#output-image').src = URL.createObjectURL(blob);

// Cleanup
client.destroy();
```

**Notes:**
- `seed` ensures same image if repeated
- Auto cleanup removes `chatId` after generate
- Set `width`/`height` for image size
